            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "size": 1406,
            "text": "{\"task_id\":\"2de70e29-9e0a-4bbe-a5c8-58f8aed00c7a\",\"metadata\":{\"prompt\":\"A red paper boat drifts across a calm pond at sunrise.\",\"model_prompt\":\"integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic, a wide shot frames a calm pond reflecting the pale amber and pink glow of a low sunrise across a mist-covered surface. A small red paper boat rests near the center of the frame, floating gently on the still water. The camera pans right with small amplitude at slow speed, tracking the subtle ripples spreading outward from the paper hull as a faint breeze nudges it forward.\\n\\noverall_soundscape: A gentle morning breeze moves through nearby reeds, accompanied by the faint, smooth ripple of water lapping against the paper boat and the distant call of an early morning bird.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music: Sparse, warm ambient synthesizer tones at a slow tempo, creating a serene and quiet morning atmosphere.\",\"prompt_expansion_elapsed_ms\":1063,\"prompt_enhancement_level\":null,\"model\":\"MiniMax-H3\",\"task_type\":\"T2V\",\"seed\":870364,\"fps\":null,\"height\":480,\"width\":864,\"aspect_ratio\":\"16:9\",\"resolution_label\":null,\"duration_secs\":1.0,\"num_frames\":null,\"src_image_urls\":null,\"input_video_secs\":null,\"src_video_urls\":null,\"src_audio_urls\":null,\"src_file_urls\":null,\"src_webpage_urls\":null,\"acceleration\":null,\"adapter\":null,\"draft\":null,\"draft_source_task_id\":null},\"task_output\":null,\"moderation\":null}"
